### 5. Buscar Equipamentos (RF-04)
GET {{host}}/api/equipments?neighborhood=Bela%20Vista
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Dashboard com Resumo Preditivo (RF-03 + 3Âª Parte)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Listar Alertas (RF-05 + filtro Failure / Preventive)
GET {{host}}/api/alerts?status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

